     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>shiny is awesome (don&#39;t get me started :)</div><div><br></div><div>wondering is there is a fix for this:  toggling the shinydashboard sidebar display icon does not horizonally adjust renderPlot display.</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">shinydashboard sidebar display toggle button:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HO3VcvgtpT0/V3vBKQD1_cI/AAAAAAAABRo/sLHMAoMYlYE4I9JGYOAQ3P55r_OK8O_ewCLcB/s1600/shinydashboard%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay%2Btoggle%2Bicon.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HO3VcvgtpT0/V3vBKQD1_cI/AAAAAAAABRo/sLHMAoMYlYE4I9JGYOAQ3P55r_OK8O_ewCLcB/s1600/shinydashboard%252Bsidebar%252Bdisplay%252Btoggle%252Bicon.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392922985000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0JCneef2aSpwxDH7R2UYdr\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-HO3VcvgtpT0/V3vBKQD1_cI/AAAAAAAABRo/sLHMAoMYlYE4I9JGYOAQ3P55r_OK8O_ewCLcB/s1600/shinydashboard%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay%2Btoggle%2Bicon.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a> </p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">before toggle:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-E2bzTLFsMys/V3vBTdMHQHI/AAAAAAAABRw/lxTlMtbcNcg4IbJRcUlIVDQHXCnpsmuwQCLcB/s1600/with%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-E2bzTLFsMys/V3vBTdMHQHI/AAAAAAAABRw/lxTlMtbcNcg4IbJRcUlIVDQHXCnpsmuwQCLcB/s1600/with%252Bsidebar%252Bdisplay.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392922986000&amp;usg=AOvVaw30CRsWhhX_rr4SCV_nEgL4\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-E2bzTLFsMys/V3vBTdMHQHI/AAAAAAAABRw/lxTlMtbcNcg4IbJRcUlIVDQHXCnpsmuwQCLcB/s320/with%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"86\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">after toggle:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GiF_j4ReESo/V3vBaSId05I/AAAAAAAABR0/U4Y4dN-_THsJe2_Sm3YdRlNksz5Z5H-OgCLcB/s1600/without%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GiF_j4ReESo/V3vBaSId05I/AAAAAAAABR0/U4Y4dN-_THsJe2_Sm3YdRlNksz5Z5H-OgCLcB/s1600/without%252Bsidebar%252Bdisplay.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392922986000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mr_ayiwOfdvxdGrJ_kGzP\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GiF_j4ReESo/V3vBaSId05I/AAAAAAAABR0/U4Y4dN-_THsJe2_Sm3YdRlNksz5Z5H-OgCLcB/s320/without%2Bsidebar%2Bdisplay.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"84\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>adjusting window size DOES appriopriately resize the renderPlot horizontally, but toggling the sidebar display does not.   Code below.  Thanks for advice!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>ui &lt;- dashboardPage(</div><div>  dashboardBody(</div><div>    fluidRow(</div><div>      box(</div><div>        width = 6, status = &quot;info&quot;, solidHeader = TRUE,</div><div>        title = &quot;Top Providers in Region&quot;,</div><div>        plotOutput(&quot;topDocs&quot;)</div><div>      ),</div><div>      box(</div><div>        width = 6, status = &quot;info&quot;, solidHeader = TRUE,</div><div>        title = &quot;Top Procedures In Region&quot;,</div><div>        plotOutput(&quot;topProcs&quot;)      )))</div><div><br></div><div>server &lt;- function(input, output) {</div><div><br></div><div># for brevity, not showing reactive functions containing ggplot code</div><div><br></div><div>shinyApp(ui, server)</div><div>  output$topProcs &lt;- renderPlot({</div><div>    TPplot()  })</div><div>  output$topProcs &lt;- renderPlot({</div><div>    TPplot() })  }</div></div>"
